{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Desert Fireplace is a piece of ",["l","家具","furniture"]," that can be purchased on ",["l","春季","Spring 17"]," for 20 Calico Eggs ",["l","卡利科三花蛋","Calico Egg"],"s from the ",["l","沙漠节#Calico Egg Merchant","Calico Egg Merchant"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"],". It may be placed anywhere indoors."]],["p",["Once placed, right-clicking on it will turn the fire on or off."]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Introduced."]]]]]]]}